Subject: [PATCH 01/13] @ Phase 1: Add Qwen3VL configuration classes

- Add Qwen3VLVisionConfig dataclass (vision encoder config)
- Add Qwen3VLConfig dataclass (top-level multimodal config)
- Register qwen3_vl in CONFIG_CLASS_MAP
- Add unit tests for new config classes

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>
@
---
 lite_llama/executor/executor_struct.py |   3 +-
 lite_llama/models/model_config.py      | 107 +++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 109 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

